s date is correct\" → No. Just web search it.\n- \"Review my grocery list\" → No. Not worth multi-model inference.\n- \"I need this answer in 5 seconds\" → No. Peer review adds 30-60s latency.\n\nEdge cases:\n- Short text (<50 words) → Models may not find meaningful issues. Consider skipping.\n- Highly technical domain → Local models may lack domain knowledge. Weight flags lower.\n- Creative writing → Factual review doesn't apply well. Use only for logical consistency.", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 1504, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/staybased/peer-review", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 87, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Peer Review", "ownerName": "staybased", "score": 74088.66995073891, "slug": "peer-review", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781503195451, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "data-analysis", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1772763445688, "description": "DocClaw is a documentation skill for OpenClaw that combines live docs search, direct markdown fetch, and offline local-doc fallback.", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 1503, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/vibecodooor/docclaw", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 27, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "DocClaw", "ownerName": "vibecodooor", "score": 81700.64644455495, "slug": "docclaw", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 7, "tags": ["docs", "openclaw"], "updated_at": 1781503195613, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.3"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779224387259, "description": "Use when the user asks to look up, search, or manage Google Contacts and the broader People API (Workspace directory). Triggers for contact lookups by name